 "controls": {
  "Light chain": "| Light chain | X X X X; keyboard J | Four stages ending in the wall-bounce breaker |",
  "Sweep": "| Sweep | ↓X | Ground low strike |",
  "Heavy chain": "| Heavy chain | Y Y Y; keyboard K | Heavy sequence with move-specific wall properties |",
  "Launcher / dash strike": "| Launcher / dash strike | ↑Y / →Y | Launch into chase; forward pressure |",
  "Air string / aerial slam": "| Air string / aerial slam | j.X X X / j.Y | Air follow-ups; slam uses the authored ground-bounce property |",
  "Five directional powers": "| Five directional powers | B, →B, ↑B, ↓B, ←B; keyboard L | Per-clasher, per-style definitions |",
  "Original neutral": "| Original neutral | hold B | Existing hold behavior; distinct from tap neutral |",
  "Ki blast": "| Ki blast | RT tap / hold / longer hold; keyboard I | Tap, charged and wave states |",
  "Signature beam": "| Signature beam | ↓RT | Existing no-meter signature with four-second cooldown |",
  "Guard": "| Guard | LT; keyboard U | Existing perfect-guard, guard-break and chip rules |",
  "Grab / throw": "| Grab / throw | LT+B, then throw follow-up | Reuse actual grab/throw states and launch behavior |",
  "Power up": "| Power up | LT+Y | Ki-charge behavior |",
  "Right-stick powers": "| Right-stick powers | flick right stick →/↑/←/↓; keyboard H + direction | Four more powers per clasher, never the B set: R→ rush (carries into the wall), R↑ rise (lifts with the rival, spikes to a ground bounce), R← pull (reels in from range), R↓ eruption (the ground under the rival launches). Names from the clasher's choreography techniques 2–5 (`battle_rpowers.gd`, Theory 2026-10-17) |",
  "Ultimates": "| Ultimates | LB / RB / LB+RB | One / three / five bars of ultimate meter |",
  "Team cutscene ultimate": "| Team cutscene ultimate | R3 (click the right stick); LB+RB+LT+RT still works | Team cinematic: needs full Team Sync and five bars (Theory 2026-10-17) |",
  "FINS": "| FINS | Clasher/style route | Read its recorded finisher route; no universal substitute |",
  "Combo View": "| Combo View | F6 / pad LT + R3 | Existing 100/75/50/30% viewing speeds; held V / L3 slow view (moved off R3 alone 2026-10-17) |"
 },
